      {
        "type": "token",
        "content": "问题片段「新员工准备加入组和角色并创建账号，口头同意是否足够？」：本次检索到的资料不足以对此作出确定判断；不能据此认定允许或禁止。\n\n问题片段「资料对成员资格条件和创建请求批准分别怎样要求？」：相关要求见下方原文。 依据：[资料1]第4行片段1；[资料1]第9行片段1；[资料1]第29行片段1\n\n辅助译文由AI核对，属于非官方译文；引用的原文为来源依据。\n\n控制条款须按原文适用条件执行；参数值待定不表示动作可选，不能据此省略原文明确要求的动作。\n\n[资料1]原文第4行片段1\n辅助译文：对组和角色成员资格要求{{ insert: param, ac-02_odp.01 }}；\n原文：\n> [ac-2_smt.c] Require {{ insert: param, ac-02_odp.01 }} for group and role membership;\n\n[资料1]原文第9行片段1\n辅助译文：账号创建请求须获得{{ insert: param, ac-02_odp.03 }}的批准；\n原文：\n> [ac-2_smt.e] Require approvals by {{ insert: param, ac-02_odp.03 }} for requests to create accounts;\n\n[资料1]原文第29行片段1\n辅助译文：ac-02_odp.01：组和角色成员资格的前提与准则，待定义。\nac-02_odp.02：每个账号所需的属性，待定义。\nac-02_odp.03：批准创建账号请求的人员或角色，待定义。\nac-02_odp.04：创建、启用、修改、禁用及移除账号的政策、程序、前提与准则，待定义。\nac-02_odp.05：需通知的人员或角色，待定义。\nac-02_odp.06：账号不再需要时通知账号管理员的期限，待定义。\nac-02_odp.07：用户离职或调动时通知账号管理员的期限，待定义。\nac-02_odp.08：个人系统使用或知悉需要变化时通知账号管理员的期限，待定义。\nac-02_odp.09：授权系统访问所需的属性，待定义。\nac-02_odp.10：账号审查的频次，待定义。\n原文：\n> [{\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.01\", \"label\": \"prerequisites and criteria\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"prerequisites and criteria for group and role membership are defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.02\", \"label\": \"attributes (as required)\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"attributes (as required) for each account are defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.03\", \"label\": \"personnel or roles\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"personnel or roles required to approve requests to create accounts is/are defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.04\", \"label\": \"policy, procedures, prerequisites, and criteria\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"policy, procedures, prerequisites, and criteria for account creation, enabling, modification, disabling, and removal are defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.05\", \"label\": \"personnel or roles\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"personnel or roles to be notified is/are defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.06\", \"label\": \"time period\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"time period within which to notify account managers when accounts are no longer required is defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.07\", \"label\": \"time period\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"time period within which to notify account managers when users are terminated or transferred is defined; \"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.08\", \"label\": \"time period\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"time period within which to notify account managers when system usage or the need to know changes for an individual is defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.09\", \"label\": \"attributes (as required)\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"attributes needed to authorize system access (as required) are defined;\"}]}, {\"id\": \"ac-02_odp.10\", \"label\": \"frequency\", \"guidelines\": [{\"prose\": \"the frequency of account review is defined;\"}]}]\n\n【出处】[资料1]《NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL》定位【ac-2】"
